#: src/konqtabs.cpp:151
msgid ""
"This bar contains the list of currently open tabs. Click on a tab to make it "
"active. You can also use keyboard shortcuts to navigate through tabs. The "
"text on the tab is the title of the website currently open in it; place your "
"mouse over the tab to see the full title, in case it has been truncated to "
"fit the tab width."
msgstr ""
"Disse Balken bargt de List vun opstunns apen Paneels. En Klick op en Paneel "
"hoolt dat na vörn. Du kannst ok mit Tastkombinatschonen twischen de Paneels "
"wesseln. De Text op't Paneel wiest den Titel vun de Nettsiet, de opstunns "
"dor binnen wiest warrt; wenn he to lang is, warrt de hele Titel wiest, wenn "
"Du dor mit de Muus op wiest."

